      "unit_mechtool"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Heavy PPC Backstabber",
  "YangsThoughts": "This mech is a solution in need of a problem. Nobody needs a 65 ton mech to move that fast, and it doesn't even have jumpjets, so you can't take advantage of the mobility most of the time. On the plus side, any medium mechs you catch will be crushed beneath this thing's fists. Just, go easy on those PPCs. They run too hot for the cooling system to handle.",
